{"input_text": "Question: When I have a table of values like
\begin{array}{c|ccccc}
x & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 \\
y & 3 & 6 & 8 & 9 & 0 \\
y & 4 & 6 & 1 & 2 & 4
\end{array} 
